{"ref":"BDB, מִפְקָד²","hw":"מִפְקָד²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִפְקָד</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>muster, appointment, appointed place</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> only in <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁעַר הַמּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:31\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.31\">Ne 3:31</a>, v. i. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, שַׁ֫עַר\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_שַׁ֫עַר\">שַׁעַר</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִפְקַד</span>:<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>muster</em> of people <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.9\">2 S 24:9</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 21:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.21.5\">1 Ch 21:5</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>appointment</em> of (by) Hezekiah <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.13\">2 Ch 31:13</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>appointed place</em> of (in) temple <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.21\">Ez 43:21</a> (Krae <em>watch, guard-house;</em> Kö<sup>ii 1, 93</sup> conj. <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹקֵד</span>).","next":"BDB, פְּקוֹד","prev":"BDB, פִּקָּדוֹן"}